# Optional local reference copy of the private ADWS_Pro source. Not distributed
# with this repo; only needed to re-run `node parity/run-parity.js --freeze`
# against the live originals. Parity otherwise verifies against frozen baselines.
ADWS_PRO_source/

# Evidence trees produced when the skill runs a job (never committed here —
# they belong in the target project).
artifacts/

# OS junk
.DS_Store

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Stray temp/scratch files
*.tmp
*.tmp.json

# Derived output of execution-report.js — regenerated on every fixture run
# (generated_at/evidence_root are machine- and time-specific, so tracking
# these caused perpetual noise diffs). run-tests.js regenerates and asserts
# on these directly; nothing depends on them being committed.
parity/execution-report-fixtures/*/artifacts/*/execution_report.json
parity/execution-report-fixtures/*/artifacts/*/execution_report.md

# Same issue: PARITY_REPORT.md embeds a generated_at timestamp + node version
# on every run-parity.js run. The actual parity evidence is the frozen
# `expected` field committed in each parity/fixtures/**/*.json — regenerate
# this report on demand with `node parity/run-parity.js`.
parity/PARITY_REPORT.md
